1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,150
A match is only a yes.

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:05,350
Reaching a real meeting still needs
people, timing and a place.

3
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:07,800
And it still needs
a shared plan.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,850
MyScoutee starts differently:
with a private, editable priority list.

5
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:15,800
Then everyone
arranges their own.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,900
Across those private choices,
mutual priorities can reveal

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:23,800
a balanced group around
one shared activity.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,700
Once the group is formed, everyone
can organize the practical parts:

9
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:31,800
people, transport,
place and supplies.

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,500
Then the plan
becomes a meeting.

11
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,150
Profiles gain voices.
Strangers gain real context.

12
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:39,800
Private priorities
stay private.

13
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,150
The next invitation begins
with shared experience,

14
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:45,300
not another cold
opening line.

15
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,700
MyScoutee is designed
for the meeting.
